# FreakCode question bank — one question per line.
# Format: category | difficulty (EASY/MEDIUM/HARD) | title | problem URL | companies (comma-separated) | description
# The seeder inserts any line whose URL is not already in the database, so you can append safely.

# --- Arrays ---
Arrays | EASY | Two Sum | https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/ | Google, Amazon | Find indices of two numbers that add up to a target.
Arrays | EASY | Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock | https://leetcode.com/problems/best-time-to-buy-and-sell-stock/ | Google, Microsoft | Maximize profit by choosing a single day to buy and a different day to sell.
Arrays | EASY | Contains Duplicate | https://leetcode.com/problems/contains-duplicate/ | Apple, Adobe | Return true if any value appears at least twice in the array.
Arrays | MEDIUM | Product of Array Except Self | https://leetcode.com/problems/product-of-array-except-self/ | Amazon, Facebook | Return an array where output[i] is equal to product of all elements except nums[i].
Arrays | MEDIUM | Maximum Subarray | https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-subarray/ | Google, PhonePe | Find the contiguous subarray with the largest sum (Kadane's Algorithm).
Arrays | MEDIUM | 3Sum | https://leetcode.com/problems/3sum/ | Amazon, Microsoft | Find all unique triplets in the array that sum up to zero.
Arrays | MEDIUM | Merge Intervals | https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-intervals/ | Google, Razorpay | Merge all overlapping intervals.
Arrays | MEDIUM | Container With Most Water | https://leetcode.com/problems/container-with-most-water/ | Google, Apple | Find two lines that together with the x-axis form a container containing the most water.
Arrays | HARD | Trapping Rain Water | https://leetcode.com/problems/trapping-rain-water/ | Google, Amazon | Compute how much water it can trap after raining.
Arrays | MEDIUM | Find the Duplicate Number | https://leetcode.com/problems/find-the-duplicate-number/ | Microsoft, Adobe | Find the duplicate number in an array of n+1 integers where each integer is between 1 and n.

